---
import type { WorkspaceData } from '../lib/pricing-workspace';
import { safeJson } from '../lib/page-data';
import '../styles/price-workspace.css';
interface Props { data: WorkspaceData }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div id="price-ledger" class="plw">
<section class="hero enter"><div><div class="row between wrap" style="gap:10px"><span></span><div class="row" style="gap:8px"><button id="currency-shortcut" class="small" title="调整人民币估算汇率" style="font-size:10px;padding:5px 9px">¥ 人民币 · 汇率 7</button><span class="pill" style="font-size:10px"><i class="dot"></i><span id="updated">数据加载中</span></span><button id="theme" hidden aria-label="切换深色外观">◐</button></div></div><div class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:10px">LIVE COST WORKSPACE</div><h2>API 单价与用量成本，<br>放在<span>同一把尺子</span>上。</h2><p>从报价台账进入模型，再用实际输入与输出量估算成本。</p><div class="row hero-meta" id="stats"></div></div><div class="signal"><div class="row between"><h3>同一份用量，不同的成本</h3><span class="unit">人民币 · 估算</span></div><div id="hero-chart"></div><div class="signal-foot">输入 100 万 + 输出 25 万 tokens · 已选模型预览</div></div></section>
<div class="notice" id="notice"></div>
<section class="enter" style="animation-delay:.08s"><div class="row between section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">01 / EXPLORE</div><h2>从一个模型，看到更多可能</h2><p>按报价来源浏览，选择模型加入下方对比。价格单位：元 / 百万 tokens。</p></div><button id="compare-shortcut" class="primary small">查看对比 ↓</button></div><div class="ledger"><aside><div class="sticky-label">报价来源</div><nav class="providers" id="providers" aria-label="选择报价来源"></nav></aside><div class="catalog"><div class="toolbar row between wrap"><div><h3 id="provider-title"></h3><div class="small muted" id="provider-subtitle"></div></div><div class="row wrap"><input id="search" class="search" type="search" placeholder="搜索全部来源的模型…" aria-label="搜索模型"><select id="model-filter" aria-label="按模型筛选" data-empty="模型"></select><select id="family-filter" aria-label="按模型系列筛选" data-empty="模型系列"></select><select id="sort" aria-label="模型排序"><option value="name">按名称</option><option value="input">输入价格 ↑</option><option value="output">输出价格 ↑</option></select></div></div><div id="filter-summary" class="filter-summary" hidden></div><div id="filter-error" class="filter-error" hidden></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><colgroup><col style="width:36%"><col style="width:16%"><col style="width:16%"><col style="width:16%"><col style="width:16%"></colgroup><thead><tr><th>模型 / 计费条件</th><th>输入单价</th><th>输出单价</th><th>缓存读取</th><th>对比</th></tr></thead><tbody id="models"></tbody></table></div><div id="catalog-empty" class="empty" hidden>没有找到匹配的模型。试试其他名称或厂商。</div><div class="pagination row between"><span id="page-label"></span><div class="row"><button id="prev" aria-label="上一页">←</button><button id="next" aria-label="下一页">→</button></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="compare-section enter" style="animation-delay:.16s" id="compare"><div class="section-heading compare-head row between"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 / COMPARE</div><h2>把差别，放在同一把尺子上</h2><p>选择 2–5 个模型；调整用量，直观看到输入与输出的成本组成。</p></div><button id="clear" class="small">清空对比</button></div><div class="workspace"><aside class="calculator"><h3>你的用量，算一算</h3><div><label for="input-volume">输入用量 / 百万 tokens</label><div class="row between"><span id="input-value" class="number amount">1</span><span class="small muted">百万</span></div><input id="input-volume" type="range" min="0" max="20" step="0.25" value="1"></div><div><label for="output-volume">输出用量 / 百万 tokens</label><div class="row between"><span id="output-value" class="number amount">0.25</span><span class="small muted">百万</span></div><input id="output-volume" type="range" min="0" max="10" step="0.25" value="0.25"></div><div class="presets"><button data-preset="1,.25">轻量试用</button><button data-preset="5,1">日常应用</button><button data-preset="20,5">高频调用</button></div><p class="hint">估算 = 输入单价 × 输入用量 + 输出单价 × 输出用量。未计缓存优惠、税费及其他附加项。价格不代表模型能力。</p></aside><div class="compare-body"><div id="selection" class="selection"></div><div class="row between wrap"><div class="tabs" id="components" aria-label="图表价格组件"><button class="active" data-component="total">用量成本</button><button data-component="input">输入</button><button data-component="output">输出</button><button data-component="cache_read">缓存读取</button><button data-component="cache_write">缓存写入</button></div><span class="small muted" id="chart-unit">元 / 当前用量</span></div><div id="plot" class="plot" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="row legend"><span><i class="input-bar"></i><span id="legend-input">输入成本</span></span><span id="legend-output"><i class="output-bar"></i>输出成本</span><span>线性比例</span></div><div class="table-scroll" style="margin-top:22px"><table class="comparison-table" id="comparison-table"></table></div><p class="small muted" id="comparison-note" style="margin-top:12px"></p></div></div></section>
<div class="fxbar row between wrap" id="fx-settings"><div class="row wrap"><span>人民币换算</span><label for="fx">1 USD =</label><input id="fx" type="number" min="0.01" max="1000" step="0.01" value="7" aria-label="美元兑人民币估算汇率"><span>CNY</span><span class="pill" id="fx-label">手动估算 · 非实时汇率</span></div><span>原始报价与来源保留在模型详情中</span></div>
<footer class="footer row between wrap"><span class="footmark">MaaS Daily / 每日自动抓取八家官方定价页。</span><span id="footer-meta"></span></footer>
<div class="toast" id="toast" role="status"></div><dialog id="detail"><div class="row between" style="margin-bottom:20px"><h3 id="detail-title"></h3><button id="close-detail" aria-label="关闭模型详情">×</button></div><p class="small muted" style="margin-bottom:18px">按计费条件查看原始报价。来源地址仅展示，便于核对。</p><div id="facts"></div></dialog>
<script id="goal-data" type="application/json" set:html={safeJson(data)} />
</div>
<script src="../scripts/price-workspace.ts"></script>
